    {
      "id": "section-4",
      "type": "garfield-proof",
      "title": "4. 证明三：加菲尔德梯形抵消法",
      "subtitle": "½(a+b)² = ab + ½c² ⇒ 两侧消去ab",
      "formula": "\\frac{1}{2}(a+b)^2 = ab + \\frac{1}{2}c^2 \\Longrightarrow a^2 + b^2 = c^2",
